stsh:formFields rdfs:comment "The predicates that are the fields of a form shape generated from this source: a list. The build makes one property shape per predicate (named stsh:<Form>_<prefix>_<local>), with that predicate's group, order, maximum count, datatype and node kind. The list is documentation in the built file; the order of the fields is their sh:order."@en ;
	rdfs:label "form fields"@en ;
	a rdf:Property .
stsh:secondary rdfs:range xsd:boolean ;
	rdfs:comment "True on a field of a form shape when the predicate is allowed but not commonly expected for that kind of node; a tool may show it in a collapsed section. Absent is treated as false. Generated from stsh:nodePrimary false for the node shape form."@en ;
	rdfs:label "secondary"@en ;
